*      FAP    7090     FLOATING POINT TRAP ROUTINE         VERSION 3    (FPT)000
       COUNT  40                                                        (FPT)010
       ENTRY  (FPT)          FROM O00010                                (FPT)020
 (FPT) SXA    AXT,4                                                     (FPT)030
       LXD    0,4            XR4=FPT SPILL CODE IN DECR.(0000)          (FPT)040
       TXL    UNDER,4,15     ONLY THE LEAST FOUR BITS HAVE MEANING      (FPT)050
 ERROR OCT 042042042042   HPR PAUSE TO INDICATE FPT ERROR - SEE XR4     (FPT)060
       TRA    AXT            PRESS START TO IGNORE ERROR                (FPT)070
       XCA               -18                                            (FPT)080
 AXT   AXT    **,4       -17                                            (FPT)090
       TRA*   0              RETURN TO TRAPPED LOCN+1 VIA 0000          (FPT)100
       TRA    ERROR      -15 / OVERFLOW IN MQ AND AC TOO - ERROR        (FPT)110
       TRA    ERROR      -14 / OVERFLOW IN AC BUT MQ O.K. - ERROR       (FPT)120
       TXI    MQ,4,64+18-13  / OVERFLOW IN MQ, AC O.K.     23 CYCLES    (FPT)130
       TRA    ERROR      -12 / OVERFLOW BUT AC AND MQ O.K. - ERROR      (FPT)140
       TXI    AC,4,9-11      / UNDERFLOW IN AC AND MQ      26 CYCLES    (FPT)150
       TXI    AC,4,17-10     / UNDERFLOW IN AC, MQ O.K.    17 CYCLES    (FPT)160
       TXI    MQ,4,18-9      / UNDERFLOW IN MQ, AC O.K.    19 CYCLES    (FPT)170
       TRA    ERROR      -8  / UNDERFLOW BUT AC AND MQ O.K. - ERROR     (FPT)180
       TXI    AC,4,64+13-7   +-*OVERFLOW IN AC AND MQ      34 CYCLES    (FPT)190
       TXI    AC,4,64+17-6   +-*OVERFLOW IN AC, MQ O.K.    21 CYCLES    (FPT)200
       TRA    ERROR       -5 +-*OVERFLOW IN MQ BUT AC O.K. - ERROR      (FPT)210
       TRA    ERROR      -4  +-*OVERFLOW BUT AC AND MQ O.K. - ERROR     (FPT)220
       TXI    AC,4,1-3       +-*UNDERFLOW IN AC AND MQ     26 CYCLES    (FPT)230
       TRA    ERROR      -2  +-*UNDERFLOW IN AC BUT MQ O.K. - ERROR     (FPT)240
       TXI    MQ,4,18-1      +-*UNDERFLOW IN MQ, AC O.K.   19 CYCLES    (FPT)250
 LIST  TRA    ERROR      -0  NOTHING HAPPENED              - ERROR      (FPT)260
 MQ    XCA                                                              (FPT)270
 AC    CLM                   FOR UNDERFLOW, SET MAG=0, KEEP SIGN        (FPT)280
       TNX    UNDER,4,64       IF UNDERFLOW,  XR4.LT.64                 (FPT)290
       ORA    INFY                OVERFLOW  XR4.GT.64,-64               (FPT)300
       STO    OVFLO          SET INDICATOR CELL=MAG=INFINITY            (FPT)310
 UNDER TRA    LIST,4         (RE-)INTERPRET SPILL CODE IN XR4           (FPT)320
 INFY  OCT    377777777777                         V.KAHAN JULY 2/63    (FPT)330
       COMMON -1                 31 LOCATIONS PLUS                      (FPT)340
 OVFLO COMMON 1                  77462 OVERFLOW INDICATOR CELL          (FPT)350
       REM  A D-P ADDRESS ERROR ON A 7094 IS TREATED AS AN ERROR.       (FPT)360
       REM  TO DELETE THE ERROR-PAUSE, WRITE ERROR TRA AXT              (FPT)370
       REM  TO CHANGE THE RESPONSE TO A SPILL-CODE, MERELY CHANGE THE   (FPT)380
       REM    APPROPRIATE TRANSFER IN LIST,4                            (FPT)390
       END                                                              (FPT)400
